<template><section id="reverse-handbook" class="reverse-handbook" aria-labelledby="reverse-handbook-title"><header class="reverse-heading"><h2 id="reverse-handbook-title"><button type="button" class="reverse-title" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="reverse-content" @click="opened=!opened"><ToolEntryIcon name="开发" />软件逆向分析手册 <span aria-hidden="true">{{opened?'▾':'▸'}}</span></button></h2><div><span>15 类手册 · 8 个本地工具</span><button type="button" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="reverse-content" @click="opened=!opened">{{opened?'收起 ▴':'展开 ▾'}}</button></div></header><div v-if="opened" id="reverse-content"><p>文件只在浏览器内读取，不上传、不执行、不修改原文件。工具文件上限 2 MiB；头解析为基础结构查看，不等于完整格式验证或反编译。切换分类保留本页文件，刷新后清空；只有主动保存的笔记会存入浏览器。</p><nav class="reverse-tabs" aria-label="逆向手册模式"><button type="button" :aria-pressed="mode==='guides'" @click="mode='guides'">分析手册</button><button type="button" :aria-pressed="mode==='tools'" @click="mode='tools'">本地分析工具</button></nav><template v-if="mode==='guides'"><input v-model="query" type="search" aria-label="搜索逆向手册" placeholder="搜索 PE / ELF / 调试 / Android / 汇编" /><nav class="reverse-tabs" aria-label="逆向手册分类"><button type="button" :aria-pressed="category===''" @click="category=''">全部分类</button><button v-for="guide in guides" :key="guide.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="category===guide.id" @click="category=guide.id">{{guide.title}}</button></nav><p>{{filtered.length}} 类结果</p><div class="reverse-grid"><article v-for="guide in filtered" :key="guide.id" class="reverse-card"><h3><ToolEntryIcon name="开发" />{{guide.title}}</h3><p>{{guide.goal}}</p><details><summary>查看步骤与示例</summary><h4>所需基础</h4><p>{{guide.prerequisite}}</p><h4>操作步骤</h4><ol><li v-for="step in guide.steps" :key="step">{{step}}</li></ol><h4>示例</h4><pre>{{guide.example}}</pre><h4>结果解释</h4><p>{{guide.interpretation}}</p><h4>常见误判</h4><p>{{guide.pitfall}}</p><h4>验证方法</h4><p>{{guide.validation}}</p><div v-if="guide.id==='tools'"><section v-for="tool in toolReferences" :key="tool.name"><strong>{{tool.name}}</strong><p>{{tool.actions}}</p><a :href="tool.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{tool.name}} 官方文档 ↗</a></section></div></details><a :href="guide.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方／标准资料 ↗</a></article></div><p v-if="!filtered.length">没有匹配内容。<button type="button" @click="query='';category=''">清除筛选</button></p></template><template v-else><nav class="reverse-tabs" aria-label="逆向本地工具"><button v-for="tool in tools" :key="tool.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="active===tool.id" @click="active=tool.id;feedback=''">{{tool.label}}</button></nav><div v-if="!['integer','notes'].includes(active)" class="reverse-card"><label>分析文件（最多 2 MiB）<input type="file" aria-label="逆向分析文件" @change="loadFile($event,'primary')" /></label><p v-if="fileName">{{fileName}} · {{bytes.length}} 字节</p><p v-if="fileHash" class="reverse-hash">SHA-256：{{fileHash}}</p><label v-if="active==='diff'">对比文件（最多 2 MiB）<input type="file" aria-label="二进制对比文件" @change="loadFile($event,'secondary')" /></label><p v-if="active==='diff'&&secondName">{{secondName}} · {{secondBytes.length}} 字节</p></div>
<section v-if="active==='integer'" aria-label="进制与字节序转换" class="reverse-grid"><div class="reverse-card"><h3>任意精度整数进制转换</h3><label>输入进制<select v-model="base"><option value="2">二进制</option><option value="8">八进制</option><option value="10">十进制</option><option value="16">十六进制</option></select></label><label>整数<input v-model="integer" aria-label="进制转换整数" maxlength="513" /></label><button type="button" @click="calculate('integer')">转换整数</button><pre v-if="results.integer" aria-label="进制转换结果">{{pretty(results.integer)}}</pre><h3>字节序（无符号）</h3><label>十六进制字节<input v-model="endian" aria-label="字节序输入" /></label><button type="button" @click="calculate('endian')">转换字节序</button><pre v-if="results.endian" aria-label="字节序结果">{{pretty(results.endian)}}</pre></div></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='hex'" aria-label="十六进制查看器" class="reverse-card"><h3>十六进制查看器</h3><label>文件偏移（十六进制）<input v-model="hexOffset" aria-label="十六进制查看偏移" /></label><div class="reverse-actions"><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes" @click="calculate('hex')">查看字节</button><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes||hexPageOffset===0" @click="hexPage(-1)">上一页字节</button><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes||hexPageOffset+256>=bytes.length" @click="hexPage(1)">下一页字节</button></div><pre v-if="results.hex" aria-label="十六进制结果">{{results.hex.map(r=>r.offset.padEnd(10)+' '+r.hex.padEnd(47)+'  '+r.ascii).join('\n')}}</pre><p>每页最多 256 字节，左侧文件偏移，中间十六进制，右侧 ASCII；非可打印字符显示为点。</p></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='pattern'" aria-label="字节特征搜索" class="reverse-card"><label>字节模式<input v-model="pattern" aria-label="字节搜索模式" placeholder="48 8B ?? ??" /></label><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes" @click="calculate('pattern')">搜索字节特征</button><p>支持重叠匹配；?? 匹配任意单字节，最多 64 字节。显示前 1000 个位置，截断标记不表示精确总数。</p><pre v-if="results.pattern" aria-label="特征搜索结果">{{pretty(results.pattern)}}</pre></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='header'" aria-label="PE／ELF 头信息查看" class="reverse-card"><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes" @click="calculate('header')">解析 PE／ELF 头</button><p>支持 PE32／PE32+ 与 ELF32／ELF64（大小端）；显示机器编号、入口、首选基址和节／LOAD 段。Mach-O、DEX、.NET 元数据查看流程见手册，不在此解析器内。</p><pre v-if="results.header" aria-label="文件头解析结果">{{pretty(results.header)}}</pre></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='strings'" aria-label="字符串提取" class="reverse-card"><label>最短连续字符数<input v-model="minString" type="number" min="2" max="128" aria-label="字符串最短长度" /></label><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes" @click="calculate('strings')">提取 ASCII 字符串</button><p>提取 ASCII 可打印字节，不解码 UTF-8 中文或 UTF-16。最多 1000 条；单条显示前 512 字符，保留原始长度和偏移。</p><pre v-if="results.strings" aria-label="字符串结果">{{pretty(results.strings)}}</pre></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='address'" aria-label="文件偏移与虚拟地址换算" class="reverse-card"><label>换算方向<select v-model="direction"><option value="fileToVA">文件偏移 → VA</option><option value="vaToFile">VA → 文件偏移</option><option value="rvaToFile">PE RVA → 文件偏移</option></select></label><label>地址（十六进制）<input v-model="address" aria-label="换算地址" /></label><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes" @click="calculate('address')">换算地址</button><p>PE 按文件首选 ImageBase，ELF 按链接 LOAD 段地址；不是 ASLR 后的实际进程地址。零填充区域没有文件字节，重叠映射取第一项。</p><output v-if="results.address" aria-label="地址换算结果">{{results.address}}</output></section>
<section v-else-if="active==='diff'" aria-label="二进制差异对比" class="reverse-card"><button type="button" :disabled="!bytes||!secondBytes" @click="calculate('diff')">比较二进制文件</button><p>逐文件偏移比较，长度增减也计为差异；不执行插入对齐、函数匹配或语义比较。显示前 200 个连续差异区间，changed 为完整比较的差异字节数。</p><pre v-if="results.diff" aria-label="二进制差异结果">{{pretty(results.diff)}}</pre></section>
<section v-else aria-label="分析笔记模板" class="reverse-card"><p>主动保存后存入当前浏览器的本地存储，不上传。共享电脑上注意笔记中可能出现的个人数据；文件字节不写入笔记存储。</p><textarea v-model="notes" aria-label="逆向分析笔记" rows="18" maxlength="100000"></textarea><div class="reverse-actions"><button type="button" @click="saveNotes">保存笔记到浏览器</button><button type="button" @click="loadNotes">读取已保存笔记</button><button type="button" @click="downloadNotes">导出分析笔记</button><button type="button" @click="appendTemplate">追加空白记录模板</button><button type="button" @click="clearSavedNotes">删除本地保存副本</button></div></section>
<p role="status" class="reverse-feedback">{{feedback}}</p></template></div></section></template>
<script>
import ToolEntryIcon from './ToolEntryIcon.vue';
import {reverseGuides,reverseTools,reverseToolReferences} from '../data/reverse-handbook.mjs';
import {MAX_BINARY_BYTES,convertInteger,endianInfo,hexRows,findPattern,inspectBinary,extractStrings,mapAddress,binaryDiff,parseInteger,NOTE_TEMPLATE} from '../utils/reverse-binary-tools.mjs';
const NOTE_KEY='01-reverse-analysis-notes';
export default {name:'ReverseHandbook',components:{ToolEntryIcon},data:()=>({opened:false,mode:'guides',category:'',query:'',guides:reverseGuides,tools:reverseTools,toolReferences:reverseToolReferences,active:'integer',base:'16',integer:'1234ABCD',endian:'78 56 34 12',bytes:null,secondBytes:null,fileName:'',secondName:'',fileHash:'',loadTokens:{primary:0,secondary:0},hexOffset:'0',hexPageOffset:0,pattern:'48 8B ?? ??',minString:4,address:'0',direction:'fileToVA',results:{},feedback:'',notes:NOTE_TEMPLATE}),computed:{filtered(){const words=this.query.trim().toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);return this.guides.filter(g=>(!this.category||g.id===this.category)&&words.every(w=>Object.values(g).flat().join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(w)));}},methods:{pretty(value){return JSON.stringify(value,null,2);},async loadFile(event,slot){const file=event.target.files?.[0],token=++this.loadTokens[slot];this.feedback='';if(slot==='primary'){this.bytes=null;this.fileName='';this.fileHash='';this.results={};this.hexOffset='0';this.hexPageOffset=0;}else{this.secondBytes=null;this.secondName='';delete this.results.diff;}if(!file)return;try{if(file.size>MAX_BINARY_BYTES)throw Error('请选择不超过 2 MiB 的文件');const data=new Uint8Array(await file.arrayBuffer());if(token!==this.loadTokens[slot])return;if(slot==='primary'){this.bytes=data;this.fileName=file.name;const digest=await crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256',data);if(token===this.loadTokens[slot])this.fileHash=Array.from(new Uint8Array(digest),b=>b.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');}else{this.secondBytes=data;this.secondName=file.name;}}catch(e){if(token===this.loadTokens[slot])this.feedback=e.message;}},calculate(kind){this.feedback='';delete this.results[kind];try{let result;if(kind==='integer')result=convertInteger(this.integer,this.base);else if(kind==='endian')result=endianInfo(this.endian);else{if(!this.bytes)throw Error('请先选择分析文件');if(kind==='hex'){const offset=parseInteger(this.hexOffset,16);if(offset<0n||offset>window.BigInt(this.bytes.length))throw Error('文件偏移超出范围');this.hexPageOffset=Number(offset);result=hexRows(this.bytes,this.hexPageOffset);}else if(kind==='pattern')result=findPattern(this.bytes,this.pattern);else if(kind==='header')result=inspectBinary(this.bytes);else if(kind==='strings')result=extractStrings(this.bytes,Number(this.minString));else if(kind==='address')result=mapAddress(inspectBinary(this.bytes),this.address,this.direction);else if(kind==='diff'){if(!this.secondBytes)throw Error('请选择对比文件');result=binaryDiff(this.bytes,this.secondBytes);}}this.results[kind]=result;}catch(e){this.feedback=e.message;}},hexPage(delta){this.hexOffset=Math.max(0,this.hexPageOffset+delta*256).toString(16);this.calculate('hex');},saveNotes(){try{localStorage.setItem(NOTE_KEY,this.notes);this.feedback='分析笔记已保存到浏览器';}catch{this.feedback='本地保存未完成，可导出笔记';}},loadNotes(){try{const saved=localStorage.getItem(NOTE_KEY);if(saved===null){this.feedback='暂无保存的笔记';return;}this.notes=saved.slice(0,100000);this.feedback='已读取保存的笔记';}catch{this.feedback='读取本地笔记未完成';}},clearSavedNotes(){try{localStorage.removeItem(NOTE_KEY);this.feedback='已删除保存副本，当前编辑内容保留';}catch{this.feedback='删除保存副本未完成';}},appendTemplate(){if(this.notes.length+NOTE_TEMPLATE.length>100000){this.feedback='笔记长度上限为 100000 字符';return;}this.notes+='\n'+NOTE_TEMPLATE;},downloadNotes(){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([this.notes],{type:'text/markdown;charset=utf-8'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='reverse-analysis-notes.md';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);this.feedback='已导出分析笔记';}}};
</script>
<style scoped>.reverse-handbook{margin:32px 20px;padding:20px;font-size:13px;scroll-margin-top:80px;}.reverse-heading,.reverse-heading>div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}h2{margin:0;}.reverse-title{border:0!important;background:transparent!important;padding:0;text-align:left;font:inherit;}.reverse-tabs,.reverse-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0;}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;}button{cursor:pointer;}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default;}input[type=search],textarea{width:100%;}.reverse-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;}.reverse-card{min-width:0;padding:16px;background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);border:1px solid var(--el-border-color-light);border-radius:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.reverse-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px;}.reverse-card h4{font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 6px;}.reverse-card label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:12px 0;}p,li{line-height:1.8;}p{color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.7 Consolas,monospace;padding:12px;background:var(--el-fill-color-light);max-height:440px;overflow:auto;}output{display:block;padding:12px;margin-top:12px;background:var(--el-fill-color-light);}summary{cursor:pointer;}a{color:var(--ui-accent);display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;}.reverse-hash{overflow-wrap:anywhere;}@media(max-width:1100px){.reverse-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));}}@media(max-width:600px){.reverse-handbook{margin:16px 12px;padding:14px;}.reverse-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}}</style>

